Unova_MusicalTheater_Z77_EventScript_Npc11_Text_0:
	.string "Happy birthday!\nI've got this festive Prop to give you!\pIt's a cake from me, the owner!\pOf course, this is a Prop, so you should\nattach it to your Pokémon and not eat it.\pBy the way, even if today isn't your\nbirthday, I won't take it back!\pWhy?\nBecause I'm the owner!$"

Unova_MusicalTheater_Z77_EventScript_Npc11_Text_1:
	.string "Wait! Please, wait!\pYou participated in a musical\nwith your friends, right?\pI felt like you opened up new possibilities\nfor musicals!\pThat's why I feel impelled to give you\nthis present! Please accept it!$"

Unova_MusicalTheater_Z77_EventScript_Npc11_Text_2:
	.string "I eagerly anticipate seeing you\non stage again!$"

Unova_MusicalTheater_Z77_EventScript_Npc11_Text_3:
	.string "Your continued participation makes me\na happy owner!\pYou're attracting a lot of attention as\nan up-and-coming stylist.\pOf course, I'm watching you closely,\nas well.\pPlease accept this as a token of\nmy appreciation.$"

Unova_MusicalTheater_Z77_EventScript_Npc11_Text_4:
	.string "Ah, I eagerly anticipate seeing you\non stage again!\p...Actually, it feels like I've said this\nline before.\pWell, that's OK. Because I'm the owner!$"

Unova_MusicalTheater_Z77_EventScript_Npc11_Text_5:
	.string "Seeing your continued participation\nmakes me a happy owner.\pApparently, some audience members have\nbeen calling you a top stylist as of late!\pBest of all... How impressive am I for\nrecognizing your talent?\pPlease accept this as a token of\nmy gratitude!$"

Unova_MusicalTheater_Z77_EventScript_Npc11_Text_6:
	.string "I hope you continue to enjoy the musical!$"

Unova_MusicalTheater_Z77_EventScript_Npc11_Text_7:
	.string "We really want you to participate in\nthe musical!\pI apologize in advance if any of our\nProps don't suit some kinds of Pokémon.\pPokémon are individuals, after all!$"

